["TOOL_CATALOG_V18", "TOOL_CATALOG", 18, "CODE_OWNED", "{\"absent_tools\":[],\"finish_records\":\"IN_GENERATION_18_ONE_BACKTEST_ANSWER_ARTIFACT_AND_ONE_ANSWER_ROW_OF_ITS_RUN; NEVER_A_DECISION_A_REVIEW_A_NOTE_OR_A_FILL\",\"id\":\"TOOL_CATALOG_V18\",\"kind\":\"TOOL_CATALOG\",\"queued_status\":\"ACCEPTED\",\"reads_at\":\"THE_STEP'S_STORED_READS; NEVER_A_LIVE_TABLE\",\"source\":\"docs/AGENT_TOOL_CONTRACTS.md M11 tool catalog v18 and ExecPlan 0056 section 4\",\"status\":\"CODE_OWNED\",\"tools\":[{\"arguments\":[\"interval\",\"candles\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR in a futures decision. The BTCUSDT perpetual's newest complete candles before the job cutoff, built from the stored final 1m candles: interval 1m, 5m, 15m or 1h; candles 1-96. Each row is open time, open, high, low, close and volume as exact decimal text. Returns nothing newer than the cutoff.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"query_futures_candles\"},{\"arguments\":[\"query\",\"limit\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR in a futures decision. Headlines of the sources in force filed under BTCUSDT that were available by the job cutoff: the newest when query is null, else the best matches of the plain query terms; limit 1-10. Each item has an evidence ID that can be cited. A headline proves that its publisher published it, not that it is true. Never a URL or a web search.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"read_headlines\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"FINISH only. EVALUATOR in a decision review. One review of the UTC day the job context holds: its day and the cases' hash, every case once with whether its outcome was knowable then, a tag from the tag list, one to three paths into the case and a short note, and one lesson. Code chose the cases and computed every score; the review changes none of them.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_decision_review\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"FINISH only. One decision on the BTCUSDT perpetual: an action with only the choices it takes from the policy's sets, advice_use, expected_move and uncertainty_level, under the rules of the trader's prompt; an entry they do not allow is refused. The server records the context it was made in; the engine computes every price, quantity, stop level, fee and margin, and reads no forecast, note or score.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_futures_decision\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"FINISH only. ANALYST in a trade coach job. One advice note for the trader: a lean, a setup with choices from the policy's sets, up to three things to avoid, the trade review IDs, decision review IDs, scoreboard row keys and scorecard row keys it rests on, and a confidence. The lean SIT_OUT is refused while fewer than ten trades are reviewed. The server adds each cited record's counts, holds the confidence at LOW while fewer than ten trades are reviewed and fewer than 288 decisions are scored at one hour, and ends the note after four hours or at the next note.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_trade_advice\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"FINISH only. EVALUATOR in a trade review. One review of the closed trade's fact sheet the job context holds: its ID and hash, the decision graded apart from its result, whether the entry's reason held, whether its invalidation was seen, one to six factors from the tag list with their evidence (fact-sheet paths or the feed items it lists), one to five tags and one lesson. The server places the trade in the call-and-luck grid from the grade and the computed result.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_trade_review\"}],\"unknown_tool\":\"UNKNOWN_TOOL\",\"version\":18}", "b479b2375f8906e6f3bca19b72d0fb820aa25c5b1c3c38ed112f41eb3c6c1c70"]
